{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Disposition: CLOSED as SCOPED-AND-SPLIT\n\nThis ticket's **documented root causes are FIXED and merged** (Gerrit change 2420 → `main` as `47713c44`):\n- **AC1 — editable-layout coupling**: release/packaging tests derived the repo root from an installed package's `__file__` (`Path(<pkg>.__file__).parents[N]`), correct only under an editable install. Fixed via install-agnostic `tests/_repo_root.py` + a RED-first AST guard. Verified: mirror run 33299427686 macOS leg has 0 `FileNotFoundError`.\n- **AC2 — hatchling floor**: declared `hatchling>=1.18` predated the PEP 639 `license-files` table form. Raised to `>=1.27` (+ `uv.lock`). Verified: floor-leg install succeeds, 0 `license-files must be a table`.\n\n**AC3 (\"a `Test Suite (mirror)` scheduled run is green on the non-`continue-on-error` legs\") is DELEGATED, not carried by this ticket.** Fixing AC1/AC2 let the supported non-editable legs run to completion for the first time, unmasking a large set of PRE-EXISTING failures (confirmed present in the pre-fix run 33285143350) that are INDEPENDENT of this ticket's editable-path/license-files root cause. Achieving \"whole sweep green\" requires dependency-constraint + production-behavior changes across ~40+ files. That residual is homed in the three `discovered_from` children, NOT tracked here:\n\n- **1f35-74fc-47a0-4d71** (`floating-chromium-leafwing`) — unbounded `anthropic` floats to 1.2.0 (vendored `httpx2`) and rejects `httpx.AsyncClient`; ~90 LLM-stack failures on the macOS + floor legs. Fix = dependency bound / provider-seam (DESIGN).\n- **c0b9-33b0-f968-450d** (`impressive-doddering-alpinegoat`) — reconciler default repo-root fallback (`__main__.py` `parents[4]`) assumes an editable checkout; wrong under non-editable. Fix = define non-editable repo-root behavior (BEHAVIOR).\n- **69e6-c32f-2634-4f30** (`piecemeal-mycologic-duckling`) — conftest REPO_ROOT-pollution guard trips on `.pytest_cache` at the floor leg (test HYGIENE).\n\nClosing this ticket as its scoped deliverable (AC1+AC2, landed & verified). AC3's residual is owned by the three children above."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788078444399634806,"uuid":"1c96102b-d60e-4b5d-a078-c6af6ac24c1c"}